# Animate Dead: as its enters ability resolves, it loses "enchant creature card in a graveyard" and gains "enchant creature
# put onto the battlefield with Animate Dead" (CR 613.1f) - whether or not the card then returns. Bot1 casts Grafdigger's
# Cage ("Creature cards in graveyards ... can't enter the battlefield"), loots a Guerrilla Gorilla away and casts Animate
# Dead on it: the Gorilla can't enter and stays in the graveyard, and Animate Dead, still attached to it but no longer
# able to enchant a card in a graveyard, is put into its owner's graveyard by the state-based actions (CR 303.4c, 704.5m).
# Its leaves-the-battlefield trigger sacrifices nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Grafdigger's Cage
Animate Dead
Swamp
Guerrilla Gorilla
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
